<title>USA: Florida to sell $45 mln revenue bonds Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $45 mln revenue bonds Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $45.395 million of state Board of Regents revenue refunding bonds on Tuesday at 11 a.m. EDT, the state Division of Bond Finance said Monday.</p>
<p>The bonds are Board of Regents, University System Improvement Revenue Refunding Bonds, Series 1997 A.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
</text>
